        "created_at": "2026-10-17T17:49:01.911Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I’m Shital, an n8n and AI Automation Specialist specializing in building production-ready, resilient backend architectures that guarantee 0% data loss.</p>\n<p><strong>Proof, not just a pitch:</strong><br>\nInstead of building simple, fragile workflows, I engineer “hardened” systems. You can check my production-ready blueprints on GitHub: <a href=\"http://github.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com</a></p>\n<p><strong>What I can build and fix for you in 48 hours:</strong><br>\n• <strong>Webhook &amp; API Ingestion Optimization:</strong> Implementing SHA-256 Idempotency gates to prevent duplicate event delivery, double-billing, or duplicate database records.<br>\n• <strong>Zero Data Loss Infrastructure:</strong> Setting up Redis Dead Letter Queues (DLQ) so if your main API/CRM drops, your customer data is safely queued and auto-retried.<br>\n• <strong>Conversational Real Estate AI Agents:</strong> Built a production-grade WhatsApp system with dynamic Gemini intent extraction and Redis atomic slot-locking to prevent calendar booking conflicts.<br>\n• <strong>CRM Pipelines:</strong> Resilient 2-way syncs for HubSpot, Zoho, and PostgreSQL ledgers with token optimization (reduces API token overhead by 42%).</p>\n<p>Available immediately for fixed-price projects or quick emergency workflow fixes.<br>\nDM me here, check my Fiverr profile, or connect on LinkedIn: [<a href=\"https://github.com/katreshital11-commits/ai-n8n-automation\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Your LinkedIn Link</a>]</p>\n<p>What workflow error is breaking your production stack right now?</p>\n<hr>",
